# Privacy Policy - Ultimate Publisher

**Last Updated:** July 18, 2026

## 1. Information We Collect

### 1.1 Personal Information
- Account Information: Name, email address, profile picture
- Social Media Account Data: Access tokens and basic account information
- Content Data: Videos, images, captions, and metadata

### 1.2 Automatically Collected Information
- Device Information: Model, OS version, device identifiers
- Usage Data: App usage patterns, features accessed
- Performance Data: Crash reports, performance metrics

## 2. How We Use Your Information
- Connect and manage social media accounts
- Create, schedule, and publish content
- Generate AI-powered content suggestions
- Provide analytics and insights
- Improve app features and user experience
- Send notifications about scheduled posts
- Respond to support requests

## 3. Third-Party Services
- Google (YouTube): Channel connection and video publishing
- Facebook: Page connection and content publishing
- Instagram: Business account connection and posting
- TikTok: Account connection and content publishing
- DeepSeek AI: Content generation

## 4. Data Storage and Security
- Data stored locally on your device using encrypted storage
- Access tokens stored securely
- Industry-standard encryption protocols
- No external server storage

## 5. Data Sharing
We do not sell your personal information. Data may be shared:
- With your consent
- For legal requirements
- With trusted service providers (subject to confidentiality)

## 6. Your Rights
- Access your data
- Delete your account
- Disconnect social media accounts
- Opt-out of analytics
- Export your data

## 7. Children's Privacy
Not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13.

## 8. Changes to This Policy
Updates will be posted in the app with a new "Last Updated" date.

## 9. Contact Us
Email: support@ultimatepublisher.com
Website: https://ultimatepublisher.com

## 10. Data Deletion
To delete your data:
1. Open the app
2. Go to Settings > Account
3. Tap "Delete Account"
4. Confirm deletion

Or email: support@ultimatepublisher.com
